// Creator এর USDC withdrawal request।
// Consumer এর জন্য এই model নেই — তারা withdraw করতে পারবে না।
model CreatorWithdrawal {
    id        String @id @default(uuid())
    creatorId String

    amountUsdc Decimal @db.Decimal(18, 6)

    status WithdrawalStatus @default(PENDING)

    // Duplicate withdrawal ঠেকাতে।
    idempotencyKey String @unique

    // Circle থেকে আসা transfer ID — reconciliation এর জন্য।
    circleTransferId String?
    txHash           String?

    // Destination — creator এর external wallet address।
    destinationAddress String

    attempts  Int     @default(0)
    lastError String?

    createdAt   DateTime  @default(now())
    completedAt DateTime?
    updatedAt   DateTime  @updatedAt

    creator CreatorProfile @relation(fields: [creatorId], references: [id])

    @@index([creatorId])
    @@index([status])
}

enum WithdrawalStatus {
    PENDING
    PROCESSING
    COMPLETED
    FAILED
}
